          "page_number": 1,
          "quote": "Conclusion: the mean is exactly 10.0 cm with no remaining limitations."
        }
      ],
      "interpretation": "The student conflates random error reduction with systematic error elimination, which is a critical conceptual error in uncertainty analysis.",
      "finding": "insufficient_evidence",
